  "id": "D_kwDOKrJqmc4AkAxo",
  "number": 866,
  "title": "Orbic 400L Non-Responsive, Unable to Tether",
  "body": "I recently purchased a few Orbic 400L hotspots on eBay that displayed they were on 1.1.5 firmware, but didn't allow any connection via USB or Wifi to allow installation. I was able to solve this via updating the firmware with the RC400L Upgrade Tool (https://www.orbic.us/support/orbicspeed/RC400L_Upgrade_Tool_Setup_20210624.exe). This updated it to 1.2.x and allowed me to tether and do a proper installation via wifi/usb.",
  "author": {
    "login": "FusedStamen",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129631594?u=dd7a8badfce90259ae7e8a90f1a4c6264d0b8a5e&v=4",
